  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add an opt-in, auto-hidden vertical scrollbar to multiline editors. Scroll in displayed rows across wrapped text with Ctrl+Up/Down, the mouse wheel, arrow buttons, track paging, and thumb dragging; clamp an off-screen caret to the approaching viewport edge. Render standard ▲/▼/│/┃ chrome through existing theme roles and compose it with the decorative line-number gutter. Preserve AssemblyVersion 1.0.0.0, Icod.DCurses 2.5.2, and the .NET 8/9/10 targets.",
